              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwine bulya, imfumu yasangulula incende ya pakati ka lubansa ulwali ku ntanshi ya ŋanda yakwa Yawe, epo atuulila amalambo yakoca, umutuulo wa cabunga na mafuta ya mituulo yakwampana, pantu ubulambo bwa mukuba ubwakwa Yawe bwali ubunono ubwakutuulilapo amalambo yakoca, imituulo ya cabunga na mafuta ya mituulo yakwampana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.8.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.8.64"
            ]
          }
        }
