        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Solomoni na bena Israeli bonse ali nabo pali ilya nshita epakusefya inshikunkulu. Abantu bali abengi abafumine ukutendekela ku Lebo Hamati",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.8.65",
