        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwakonkelepo asalanganya abantu bonse. Abantu nabo batasha imfumu, babwelela ku mayanda yabo abasansamuka no kusekelela mu mitima pa fisuma fyonse Yawe acitile umubomfi wakwe Davidi na bantu bakwe Abena Israeli.",
